# 21. إعادة احتساب الأرصدة

بعد كل عملية:

```text
total_paid = sum(payments.amount where status paid)
total_received = sum(receipts.received_amount)
total_fees = sum(payments.fee_amount + direct fees)
remaining_to_pay = expected_total_to_pay - total_paid
```

للجمعية باسم الشركة:

قبل الاستلام:

```text
asset_balance = total_paid
liability_balance = 0
```

بعد الاستلام:

```text
asset_balance = max(total_paid_before_receipt - asset_closed_amount, 0)
liability_balance = max(expected_receive_amount - total_paid_before_receipt, 0)
```

بعد دفع الأقساط المتبقية:

```text
liability_balance decreases with each payment
```

للجمعية الشخصية:

```text
owner_drawings_balance = total_paid - amount_returned_to_company
```

لجمعية الموظف:

```text
employee_receivable_balance = total_paid - employee_repayments
```

